# Return to Delkfutt's Tower: the status requirement. After the login's zone-in has set status 1, a GM sets
# 0: _4z0 says NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY (7612, the battlefield framework's refusal) and 32767 (DefaultActions'
# messageSpecial -1); at 2 the same; at 1 it opens the menu (32000, bit 1).
lists StellarFulcrum/_4z0/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/onEventUpdate/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32001 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32002 StellarFulcrum/onZoneIn/1 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/17 StellarFulcrum/_4z1/onTrigger
char zone=StellarFulcrum pos=-520,-4,17 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ReturnToDelkfuttsTower current
login                                   # the mission's zone-in 0 at status 0, answered: status 1
missionstatus Zilart 0
trigger _4z0                            # status 0: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY, 32767
missionstatus Zilart 2
trigger _4z0                            # status 2: NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY, 32767
missionstatus Zilart 1
trigger _4z0                            # status 1: the menu
finish
